  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Micro-projects for Private Sector Development in Chad</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This projects enables the Netherlands embassy office in N&apos;Djamena, Chad, to provide relative small budget to local organizations, to come up with their ideas and proposals for local private sector development.Local organizations get the chance to get funding to implement relatively small-scale initiatives in order to create impact for their beneficiaries or constituencies. Potential scale up of these initiatives is possible if the project implementation has been successful and scalable, and the local organization has proven itself to be a reliable partner.</narrative>
  </description>
